pve-qemu-anti-detection (1.0.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add --cn/--china flag for China mainland mirror mode (GitHub mirrors)
  * Add USE_CN_MIRROR config option for persistent mirror setting
  * Fix KVM CPUID signature: remove kvm.c patch to preserve Linux VM
    paravirtualization (kvm-clock, PV EOI, PV spinlocks, PV IPIs)
  * Update documentation with China mirror instructions and KVM/Windows
    VM configuration guidance

